### 05. Assets & Fleet API Requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "angel@unggul.co.id",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Get Fleet Settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fleet/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Unit Statuses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/units/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Update Unit Status
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/units/DT5108/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ready",
  "loc": "Panel East Tengah"
}

### Get Unit History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/units/DT5108/history
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Unit Database
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/units/db
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
